A note on the one substantive decision, kept to the task's own terms: the enrichment fetch sends the customer's `question` to an outbound host, which is authority the original `with` clause did not grant. I added `import aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0;` to the world so the body can make the call, since you asked for it to be included. For this to be sound under the graph's model, the node's `with` clause must actually be extended with the corresponding `HTTPClient<['metadata.internal.example']>` capability — the host will trap the `fetch` at the boundary otherwise. The import in the world is necessary but not by itself the grant.

